  <collaboration id="Id_063f0351-0c41-4466-8510-6b9d832021f6" name="P12. Análise do Projeto">
    <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Processo de an&amp;aacute;lise das adapta&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do projeto padr&amp;atilde;o para as condi&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es locais considerando a sinergia entre as atividades diversas dos munic&amp;iacute;pios, do FNDE e da Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133/2021 - Lei de Licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e Contratos Administrativos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
